{"speciesId":256,"names":{"fr":"Galifeu","es":"Combusken","en":"Combusken","ja":"ワカシャモ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"COMBUSKEN toughens up its legs and thighs by running through fields and mountains. This POKéMON’s legs possess both speed and power, enabling it to dole out ten kicks in one second."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"COMBUSKEN battles with the intensely hot flames it spews from its beak and with outstandingly destructive kicks. This POKéMON’s cry is very loud and distracting."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It lashes out with 10 kicks per second. Its strong fighting instinct compels it to keep up its offensive until the opponent gives up."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It boosts its concentration by emitting harsh cries. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It boosts its concentration by emitting harsh cries. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"During a battle, the hot flame in its body increases. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"During a battle, the hot flame in its body increases. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce maître du coup de pied peut donner 10 coups par seconde. Ses cris aigus intimident l’ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce maître du coup de pied peut donner 10 coups par seconde. Ses cris aigus intimident l’ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce maître du coup de pied peut donner 10 coups par seconde. Ses cris aigus intimident l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su habilidad le permite dar diez patadas por segundo. Lanza potentes gritos para intimidar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"１秒間に キックを １０発 繰り出す 足技の 持ち主。 鋭い 鳴き声で 威嚇する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Au combat, les flammes dans son corps redoublent d’intensité. Ses coups de pied sont dévastateurs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al pelear, el fuego de su interior se intensifica. Es capaz de propinar unas patadas demoledoras."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"During a battle, the hot flame in its body increases. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"戦いに なると 体内の 炎が 激しく 燃え上がる。 キックは 破壊力 抜群だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Galifeu muscle ses cuisses et ses mollets en courant dans les champs ou dans les montagnes. Les jambes de ce Pokémon sont très puissantes et rapides, capables de donner 10 coups de pied en 1 seconde."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Combusken fortalece las piernas corriendo por llanos y montañas. Este Pokémon tiene en las extremidades inferiores tanto fuerza como velocidad. Puede dar hasta diez patadas por segundo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Combusken toughens up its legs and thighs by running through fields and mountains. This Pokémon’s legs possess both speed and power, enabling it to dole out 10 kicks in one second."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"野山を 走り回って 足腰を 鍛える。 スピードと パワーを 兼ね備えた 足は １秒間に １０発の キックを 繰り出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Galifeu combat grâce aux flammes ardentes qu’il crache de son bec et à ses coups de pied destructeurs. Le cri de ce Pokémon est très puissant et très gênant pour l’adversaire."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Combusken lucha haciendo uso de las abrasadoras llamas que expulsa por el pico y de unas patadas fulminantes. Este Pokémon emite un sonido muy fuerte y molesto."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Combusken battles with the intensely hot flames it spews from its beak and with outstandingly destructive kicks. This Pokémon’s cry is very loud and distracting."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"クチバシから 吐きだす 灼熱の 炎と 破壊力 抜群の キックで 戦う。 鳴き声が 大きいので とても やかましい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":256,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],